      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded after the 1803 Louisiana Purchase, Fulton grew into a 19th‑century steamboat port trading cotton along the Red River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
