      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/fulton_arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Cairo and Fulton Railroad, chartered in 1852, linked southern Illinois to Fulton’s Red River crossing.",
